  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nRight now there is no way to limit links to only be visible to Group Members. This means that when you have an Invite or Request Only Group you can't for example add a link to a corresponding Discord for that Group, as people who aren't even in the Group could also just join.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nAdd something like `Link Visibility` which allows us to set who can see a Link. It could allow for Links to be `Public`, `Members Only` or limit it to a specific Group Role.\n\nThis would allow Groups to add links for things like their Discord without needing to worry about random people joining.",
